mcp — third-party attribution

Two things in this module come from elsewhere; their licenses follow and must
travel with these files. Everything else is this collection's own.

1. src/uri_template.zig — the MATCHING algorithm (flattening a template into
   literal and capture atoms; the prefix / one multi-segment capture / suffix
   partition; the lazy-left, greedy-right scans; the lenient trailing-query
   match; the rules for which templates are unmatchable) is ported, re-expressed
   in Zig, from the official MCP Python SDK v2.3.0, src/mcp/shared/uri_template.py
   (github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk). SOURCE (algorithm port, not a
   line-for-line copy). The parser, expander and percent-decoding are this
   collection's own.

